WEBVTT

00:14:59.101 --> 00:15:00.755
at the border,

00:15:00.779 --> 00:15:02.999
at the ballot box,

00:15:03.023 --> 00:15:04.898
in our workplaces,

00:15:05.930 --> 00:15:09.473
right in our homes, full of moral choices.

00:15:11.267 --> 00:15:17.273
As you go about your day
and you encounter these moral choices,

00:15:17.297 --> 00:15:18.799
think of Lily.

00:15:20.323 --> 00:15:21.948
Think like Lily.

00:15:23.083 --> 00:15:29.530
Think like a domestic worker
who shows up and cares no matter what.